OL,11,G2145 The Essay: John Foxx - Key Moments
OL,12,     FJohn Foxx takes us through the
OL,13,     Fhistory of the five pianos which
OL,14,     Fhave shaped his music. As the lead
OL,15,     Fsinger of Ultravox, and a solo
OL,16,     Fartist, pianos have been his
OL,17,     Flife-long obsession.
